  "generation_prompts": [
    "Create ONLY a polished photographic editorial background for a 1080\u00d71920 portrait Instagram Story about U.S. new job postings on Indeed slipping below their February 2020 baseline. It is a conceptual jobs-and-employment environment, not evidence of a specific office, employer, layoffs, or named business. Full bleed, expensive understated business magazine photography. The scene is a modern American office recruitment reception: deep blue-gray glass and brushed dark graphite architectural wall, restrained warm brass accents, a long corridor with soft lights and a desk corner, a closed unbranded laptop and neatly stacked paper visible mainly across the bottom quarter. No people, no empty employee chairs suggesting layoffs, no logos, no readable text, no signs, no numbers, no graphs, no data marks.\n\nComposition is exact: keep the main content region x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536 calm, extremely dark charcoal-blue, smooth and uncluttered, with sufficient contrast for light typography and a black source chart which will be overlaid separately. Most recognizable office details belong to side margins and below y1560. Include a realistic flush round brass wall recess mounted in the upper-right architectural panel, outer diameter 190px centered at x933,y273 in 1080\u00d71920 coordinates, with an empty plain inset circle diameter180px and realistic contact shading. This will receive the real supplied Moneyberg coin later as a separately composited, uniformly scaled original PNG at x843,y183,size180. DO NOT generate or imitate any coin, face, portrait, seal, lettering, emblem, watermark or logo. The physical recess must look built into the environment, softly lit in warm gold, with perspective frontal so the exact circular artwork can be seated naturally and kept undistorted, full rim within the top75% of the image. The background needs to support an original coin with full circular rim and unchanged letterforms, not an isolated pasted-on badge.\n\nTypography is composited later with actual Lato Black weight900 for headlines, labels and a compact one-line MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF masthead; Georgia weight400 for body and sources. Minimum authored sizes33px, body35px, headline51px. All news text, source qualifiers, and the complete actual unchanged source chart will sit wholly inside x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536. Do not render any typography. The original source chart is placed as a complete rectangular image at x104,y820,width857,height572; preserve a dark quiet field here, with no dramatic highlights behind it. This requested image contains only the environment and the EMPTY engineered coin recess. Photorealistic natural materials, selective focus and subtle film grain, sophisticated slate-blue palette with soft tungsten glints, no neon, no decorative stock charts, no fabricated interface."
  ],
